     "do": [
      {
       "action": "highlight",
       "target": "cost[1]"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "say": {
      "en": "So a gather is much slower per element than a unit-stride load. But it is still far faster than a scalar loop, which pays instruction overhead and stalls on every element."
